00:02:27.629 --> 00:02:33.660
So Cats is a very weird musical to adapt into
a movie because it's basically cats introducing

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:37.459
themselves for 90 minutes, and then one of
them gets to die.

00:02:37.459 --> 00:02:43.260
